  "content": "\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14.3px;line-height:1.7\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/5/264/80/80/635351429324826696.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"80\" height=\"29\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14.3px;line-height:1.7\">Redstone Arsenal 新增了運用紅石動力（Redstone Flux）的工具與武器，該能源系統由 CoFH 與 Thermal Expansion 加入。</span></p>\n<p>遊玩此模組需要安裝 CoFH Core！可在此處找到：<a href=\"http://www.curse.com/mc-mods/minecraft/cofhcore\" rel=\"nofollow\">CoFH Core</a></p>\n<p>如需更多關於此模組的詳細資訊，請前往 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=http%253a%252f%252fteamcofh.com%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">TeamCoFH</a> 官方網站！</p>\n<h3>Discord</h3>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscordapp.com%252finvite%252fuRKrnbH\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://discordapp.com/invite/uRKrnbH</a></p>\n<h3>更新日誌</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/CoFH/Version/blob/master/redstonearsenal_changelog.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://github.com/CoFH/Version/blob/master/redstonearsenal_changelog.txt</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
